8, 242)\">:</span><span class=\"token plain\"> </span><span class=\"token string\" style=\"color:rgb(255, 121, 198)\">&quot;tool&quot;</span><span class=\"token punctuation\" style=\"color:rgb(248, 248, 242)\">,</span><span class=\"token plain\"> </span><span class=\"token string\" style=\"color:rgb(255, 121, 198)\">&quot;tool_call_id&quot;</span><span class=\"token punctuation\" style=\"color:rgb(248, 248, 242)\">:</span><span class=\"token plain\"> </span><span class=\"token string\" style=\"color:rgb(255, 121, 198)\">&quot;...&quot;</span><span class=\"token punctuation\" style=\"color:rgb(248, 248, 242)\">,</span><span class=\"token plain\"> </span><span class=\"token string\" style=\"color:rgb(255, 121, 198)\">&quot;content&quot;</span><span class=\"token punctuation\" style=\"color:rgb(248, 248, 242)\">:</span><span class=\"token plain\"> </span><span class=\"token string\" style=\"color:rgb(255, 121, 198)\">&quot;...&quot;</span><span class=\"token punctuation\" style=\"color:rgb(248, 248, 242)\">}</span><br></div></code></pre>","<pre tabindex=\"0\" class=\"prism-code language-text codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2;background-color:#282A36\"><code class=\"codeBlockLines_e6Vv\"><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\">┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐</span><br></div><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\">│  Main thread                  API thread           │</span><br></div><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\">│                                                    │</span><br></div><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\">│   wait on:                     HTTP POST           │</span><br></div><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\">│    - response ready     ───▶   to provider         │</span><br></div><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\">│    - interrupt event                               │</span><br></div><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\">│    - timeout                                       │</span><br></div><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\">└────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘</span><br></div></code></pre>","<pre tabindex=\"0\" class=\"prism-code language-text codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2;background-color:#282A36\"><code class=\"codeBlockLines_e6Vv\"><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\">for each tool_call in response.tool_calls:</span><br></div><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\">    1. Resolve handler from tools/registry.py</span><br></div><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\">    2. Fire pre_tool_call plugin hook</span><br></div><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\">    3. Check if dangerous command (tools/approval.py)</span><br></div><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\">       - If dangerous: invoke approval_callback, wait for user</span><br></div><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\">    4. Execute handler with args + task_id</span><br></div><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\">    5. Fire post_tool_call plugin hook</span><br></div><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\">    6. Append {&quot;role&quot;: &quot;tool&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: result} to history</span><br></div></code></pre>"]